// detective_investigation — focused investigation pulse on a specific
// suspect. Slot id 2 (alphabetical: Accuse=1, Investigate=2, Observe=3).
//
// `damage 0.0` keeps the program parseable / well-formed without any
// real HP impact (suspects retain full HP for the entire run). The
// real effect lives in the .sim's Witnessed / EvidenceLogged event
// cascade — this .ability slot exists so the verb can dispatch via
// apply_ability and surface a chronicle record per investigation.

ability Investigate {
    target: enemy
    range: 100.0
    cooldown: 1
    hint: damage

    damage 0.0 [PHYSICAL: 100]
}
